Z||000016||Fformula88||11-17-2000||05:15 PM||||The article stated they were touring Pontiac's Special Vehicle warehouse... or something close to that outside of Detroit.  <P>Someone also posted on this... stating that it was believed that Pontiac destroyed all of the redesign concept vehicles.  (the source if I am not mistaken was Hulki Aldikacti).  <P>I wrote to Pontiac asking them about these vehicles and received absolutely no response.  It has been about two months so I am not expecting one anymore.  I am planning on trying to contact someone about that.  I have never had them NOT respond at all to a correspondence.  As soon as I know more I will post.  I figured, if they were seen on a "tour" and pictures were allowed, they would openly talk about it.  Guess not!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
